sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Vehicle (OBU)
  participant R as RSU node
  participant C as MultiChain (iovchain)
  participant T as TA node
  T->>C: grant send,receive + reports.write (configureVEH)
  T->>C: publish trust {tv: 1, active}
  V->>V: plausibility checks on beacons
  V->>R: reportSuspicion(session, suspect)
  R->>C: publishfrom vehicle -> reports
  C-->>R: block mined (round-robin)
  R->>C: analyseReports -> publish verdicts
  T->>C: read verdict, re-tally
  alt TV - 1 >= 0
    T->>C: grant send from height+30 (soft block)
  else TV - 1 < 0
    T->>C: revoke send,receive,reports.write
  end
  T->>C: publish trust {tv, status}
  V->>T: claimReward(session)
  T->>C: sendasset CREDIT 5 (+2 alarmer), publish claims
